---
import LandingLayout from "../layouts/LandingLayout.astro";
import { whatsappLink } from "../lib/brand";
const brandName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME || "Relifish";
---
<LandingLayout
  title={`Delivery & Shipping Policy · ${brandName}`}
  description={`How delivery and pickup work on ${brandName}: verified local sellers deliver within their own radius in Thane, South Mumbai and Navi Mumbai. Same-day or next-day, fees shown before you pay.`}
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <h1>Delivery &amp; Shipping Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 22 October 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-body">
      <h2>1. Who delivers</h2>
      <p>{brandName} is a marketplace and does not deliver orders itself. Orders are fulfilled by the independent, verified seller you order from. The seller delivers the order to your address, with their own staff or a courier or bike-taxi service they book (for example, Porter), or keeps it ready for pickup at their shop, as you choose at checkout (where the seller offers that option). Orders are not shipped outside the sellers' local areas.</p>

      <h2>2. Where we deliver</h2>
      <p>Sellers on {brandName} currently serve parts of Thane, South Mumbai (Tardeo) and Kamothe (Navi Mumbai). Each seller sets their own delivery radius. When you set your location, you only see sellers who can deliver to you or whose shop you can collect from.</p>

      <h2>3. When you receive your order</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Same-day orders:</strong> placed while the shop is open. The shop confirms, prepares and delivers your order the same day, or keeps it ready for pickup.</li>
        <li><strong>Pre-orders:</strong> placed for a later delivery day, before the shop's cutoff (shown on its page). Some shops let you choose a day up to 3 delivery days ahead. The shop confirms and delivers your order, or keeps it ready, on that day.</li>
        <li><strong>Delivery time:</strong> where the shop offers it, you pick a delivery time at checkout (for a same-day order, a time that ends at least 2 hours after you order). Pickup has no delivery time.</li>
        <li><strong>If your delivery time changes:</strong> the shop can change your delivery time when it accepts your order, or set an "arriving by" time when it sends the order out. You are told the new time, and the order must be delivered within it.</li>
        <li><strong>Before your order goes out:</strong> the shop confirms with {brandName} before sending your order out for delivery, and we check that you are available to receive it. If we can't reach you, {brandName} and the shop will agree the next step with you.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can follow the status of your order (paid, confirmed, out for delivery or ready for pickup, completed) on your order tracking page. For delivery timing, message us and we'll check with the shop.</p>

      <h2>4. Delivery charges</h2>
      <p>Delivery fees are set by each seller (a flat fee or a per-km fee, and some sellers deliver free above an order amount). The delivery fee and the seller's minimum order, if any, are shown at checkout before you pay. Pickup has no delivery charge.</p>

      <h2>5. Failed or late delivery</h2>
      <p>If the shop cannot fulfil your order, it will decline or cancel it and you get a full refund to your original payment method, usually within 5 to 7 working days.</p>
      <p><strong>Late delivery:</strong> if your order hasn't arrived 1 hour after the end of its delivery time, you can cancel it for a full refund to your original payment method. If the Cancel button isn't shown on your order page, message us (below) and we'll cancel it for you.</p>
      <p>Whoever cancels an order, you or the shop, gives a short written reason. If something else is wrong with a delivery, message us and we'll check with the shop. See also our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>WhatsApp <a href={whatsappLink("Hi Relifish, I have a question about delivery")} target="_blank" rel="noopener">+91 9152207607</a> · <a href="mailto:relifishstore@gmail.com">relifishstore@gmail.com</a> · 7:30 AM to 9 PM. <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</LandingLayout>
